/*
  core/masks/attentive_calc.spthy -- f_H for the Attentive mask, CALC_SK action.
  (Action-scoped: an experiment that does not use CALC_SK must not include this file, or its
   LHS fact !Req would be unproduced -- a hard wellformedness failure. Attentive's
   APPROVE_REQ behaviour lives in attentive_approve.spthy.)

  §6.2 derived-mask: the mask is NOT stored state; the response IS the mask.
  Attentive answers CALC_SK correctly. RespMask(P,'Attentive') marks the response; the
  current-mask gates in core/transitions/mask_state.spthy forbid it while any degrade is active.
*/

rule Calc_Attentive:
    [ !Req(P, rid, 'CALC_SK', <Na,Nb>, c) ]
  --[ Calc(P,'Attentive'), RespMask(P,'Attentive'), Answered(rid), Key(P, kdf(Na,Nb)) ]->
    [ KeyResult(P, rid, kdf(Na,Nb)) ]
